(representing 15.0% of the Units sold in the offering), and/or up to an additional <span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNonOptionEquityInstrumentsGranted_c20250908__20250908__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__custom--SeptemberTwoThousandTwentyFivePublicOfferingMember__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__custom--SeriesAWarrantMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--UnderwritingAgreementMember_z8yrwsuJ8gE4" title="Granted of option purchase"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNonOptionEquityInstrumentsGranted" contextRef="From2025-09-082025-09-08_custom_SeptemberTwoThousandTwentyFivePublicOfferingMember_custom_SeriesAWarrantMember_custom_UnderwritingAgreementMember" id="Fact000677" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">3,214,286</ix:nonFraction></span> Series A Warrants and <span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNonOptionEquityInstrumentsGranted_c20250908__20250908__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__custom--SeptemberTwoThousandTwentyFivePublicOfferingMember__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__custom--SeriesBWarrantMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--UnderwritingAgreementMember_zjXmwk0mwTNb" title="Granted of option purchase"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNonOptionEquityInstrumentsGranted" contextRef="From2025-09-082025-09-08_custom_SeptemberTwoThousandTwentyFivePublicOfferingMember_custom_SeriesBWarrantMember_custom_UnderwritingAgreementMember" id="Fact000679" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">3,214,286</ix:nonFraction></span> Series B
Warrants at the public offering price less underwriting discounts and commissions. The Underwriter may exercise this option in whole
or in part at any time within forty-five (45) days after the date of the offering. The underwriter may exercise the over-allotment option
with respect to Class A Shares only, warrants only, or any combination thereof. On September 5, 2025, the Underwriter partially exercised
its over-allotment option and purchased additional <span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNonOptionEquityInstrumentsGranted_c20250905__20250905__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__us-gaap--OverAllotmentOptionMember__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__custom--SeriesAWarrantMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--UnderwritingAgreementMember_z6fh39THeRH5" title="Granted of option purchase"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNonOptionEquityInstrumentsGranted" contextRef="From2025-09-052025-09-05_us-gaap_OverAllotmentOptionMember_custom_SeriesAWarrantMember_custom_UnderwritingAgreementMember" id="Fact000681" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">3,214,286</ix:nonFraction></span> Series A warrants and additional <span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNonOptionEquityInstrumentsGranted_c20250905__20250905__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__us-gaap--OverAllotmentOptionMember__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__custom--SeriesBWarrantMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--UnderwritingAgreementMember_zX46XFgfkl42" title="Granted of option purchase"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNonOptionEquityInstrumentsGranted" contextRef="From2025-09-052025-09-05_us-gaap_OverAllotmentOptionMember_custom_SeriesBWarrantMember_custom_UnderwritingAgreementMember" id="Fact000683" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">3,214,286</ix:nonFraction></span> Series B Warrants for a total
of <span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNonOptionEquityInstrumentsGranted_c20250905__20250905__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__us-gaap--OverAllotmentOptionMember__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__us-gaap--WarrantMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--UnderwritingAgreementMember_zcflSQ1j1Y1a" title="Granted of option purchase"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNonOptionEquityInstrumentsGranted" contextRef="From2025-09-052025-09-05_us-gaap_OverAllotmentOptionMember_us-gaap_WarrantMember_custom_UnderwritingAgreementMember" id="Fact000685" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">6,428,572</ix:nonFraction></span> warrants at the public offering price of $<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--SharePrice_iI_c20250905__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__us-gaap--OverAllotmentOptionMember__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__us-gaap--WarrantMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--UnderwritingAgreementMember_zg6iGx0Naq85" title=" Public offering price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharePrice" contextRef="AsOf2025-09-05_us-gaap_OverAllotmentOptionMember_us-gaap_WarrantMember_custom_UnderwritingAgreementMember" id="Fact000687" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.00001</ix:nonFraction></span> per warrant in total consideration of $<span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--StockAndWarrantsIssuedDuringPeriodValuePreferredStockAndWarrants_pp2d_c20250905__20250905__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__us-gaap--OverAllotmentOptionMember__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__us-gaap--WarrantMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--UnderwritingAgreementMember_zjL57STtGsT2" title="Total warrant cosdideration value"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockAndWarrantsIssuedDuringPeriodValuePreferredStockAndWarrants" contextRef="From2025-09-052025-09-05_us-gaap_OverAllotmentOptionMember_us-gaap_WarrantMember_custom_UnderwritingAgreementMember" id="Fact000689" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="2" unitRef="USD">64.29</ix:nonFraction></span>.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Gross
proceeds of the September 2025 Public Offering, together with the partial exercise of the over-allotment option, were approximately $<span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--ProceedsFromIssuanceInitialPublicOffering_pn5n6_c20250901__20250930__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__custom--SeptemberTwoThousandTwentyFivePublicOfferingMember_zypE0VQdqC5l" title="Gross proceeds for IPO"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceInitialPublicOffering" contextRef="From2025-09-012025-09-30_custom_SeptemberTwoThousandTwentyFivePublicOfferingMember" id="Fact000691" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">6.0</ix:nonFraction></span>
