<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">During
the year ended September 30, 2025, the exercise of Series A Warrants and Series B Warrants have resulted in the issuance of <span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues_c20241001__20250930__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__custom--SeptemberTwoThousandTwentyFivePublicOfferingMember__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__custom--SeriesAWarrantMember_zfPklebdBlW3" title="Number of shares issued"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" contextRef="From2024-10-012025-09-30_custom_SeptemberTwoThousandTwentyFivePublicOfferingMember_custom_SeriesAWarrantMember" id="Fact000695" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">167,236</ix:nonFraction></span> Class
A ordinary shares and <span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues_c20241001__20250930__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__custom--SeptemberTwoThousandTwentyFivePublicOfferingMember__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__custom--SeriesBWarrantMember_zWXPTnT3ofu2" title="Number of shares issued"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" contextRef="From2024-10-012025-09-30_custom_SeptemberTwoThousandTwentyFivePublicOfferingMember_custom_SeriesBWarrantMember" id="Fact000697" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">182,790</ix:nonFraction></span> Class A Ordinary Shares, respectively. Net proceeds from the exercise of Series A Warrants and Series B
