issued and outstanding and authorized and unissued Class A ordinary shares, with an effective date of September 30, 2025. Following the
reverse split, the authorized share capital was amended as follows, while the total authorized share capital remained $<span id="xdx_909_ecustom--StockRepurchaseProgramAuthorizedAmount_iI_c20250930__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--ShareholdersAndBoardOfDirectorsMember__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--CommonClassAMember_z01GBoOjU7qa" title="Authorized share capital amount"><ix:nonFraction name="YAAS:StockRepurchaseProgramAuthorizedAmount" contextRef="AsOf2025-09-30_custom_ShareholdersAndBoardOfDirectorsMember_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember" id="Fact000705" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">50,000</ix:nonFraction></span>:</span></p>

