<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Property
and equipment are stated at cost less accumulated depreciation and impairment, if any. Depreciation is provided over the estimated useful
lives of the assets using the straight-line method from the time the assets are placed in service, after considering the estimated residual
value which is 5% of costs. The estimated useful lives are as follows:</span></p>

