<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Contract
liabilities are recognized when the Company has an obligation to transfer goods or services to a customer for which the Company has received
consideration from the customer, or when the consideration is due, prior to satisfying the related performance obligation. Contract liabilities
