<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#9632;
Uncertain Tax Position</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">As
of March 31, 2026, the Group did not have any unrecognized uncertain tax positions and the Group does not believe that its unrecognized
tax benefits will change over the next twelve months. For the six months ended March 31, 2026, the Company did not incur any interest
and penalties related to potential underpaid income tax expenses. In general, the PRC tax authority has up to five years to conduct examinations
of the Company&#8217;s tax filings. As of March 31, 2026, tax years from 2020 through 2024 for the Group&#8217;s affiliated entities
in the PRC remain open for statutory examination by the PRC tax authorities.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>



