<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify">For
the six months ended March 31, 2026, the Company had <span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--AntidilutiveSecuritiesExcludedFromComputationOfEarningsPerShareAmount_c20251001__20260331__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__custom--PreSplitMember__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__custom--SeriesAWarrantMember_zA6EtWbmZOe3" title="Antidilutive securities excluded from computation of earnings per share amount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AntidilutiveSecuritiesExcludedFromComputationOfEarningsPerShareAmount" contextRef="From2025-10-012026-03-31_custom_PreSplitMember_custom_SeriesAWarrantMember" id="Fact001954" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">90,229</ix:nonFraction></span>
potential shares issuable upon the exercise of the Representative&#8217;s Warrants, Series A Warrants and Series B Warrants. As the
Company incurred losses for the six months ended March 31, 2026, inclusion of these potential shares would have reduced the net loss
per share. Therefore, these potential shares were excluded from the calculation of diluted net loss per share.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">For
