<span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues_pid_c20251219__20251219__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--CommonClassAMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandAndTwentyFiveEquityIncentivePlanMember_zaeEycMpFzlf"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" contextRef="From2025-12-192025-12-19_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_custom_TwoThousandAndTwentyFiveEquityIncentivePlanMember" id="Fact002052" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">400,000</ix:nonFraction></span> Class A ordinary shares, par value $<span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare_iI_pid_c20251219__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--CommonClassAMember__us-gaap--PlanNameAxis__custom--TwoThousandAndTwentyFiveEquityIncentivePlanMember_zqpc4RlrbHbg"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-19_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_custom_TwoThousandAndTwentyFiveEquityIncentivePlanMember" id="Fact002053" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.008</ix:nonFraction></span> per share, for issuance under the Company&#8217;s 2025 Equity Incentive Plan (the &#8220;2025
